  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "妈妈的工作\n\n    妈妈说，她在一个饭店工作。\n    妈妈说，那是一个中国饭店。\n    妈妈说，中国菜很好吃。她们学校的学生和老师都爱吃中国菜。\n    妈妈说，她在日本学习要很多钱。\n    妈妈说，她的爸爸妈妈没有钱。\n    妈妈说，她要学习，也要工作。工作会有钱。\n    我的妈妈，她很忙。",
    "traditional": "媽媽的工作\n\n    媽媽說，她在一個飯店工作。\n    媽媽說，那是一個中國飯店。\n    媽媽說，中國菜很好吃。她們學校的學生和老師都愛吃中國菜。\n    媽媽說，她在日本學習要很多錢。\n    媽媽說，她的爸爸媽媽沒有錢。\n    媽媽說，她要學習，也要工作。工作會有錢。\n    我的媽媽，她很忙。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "妈妈说，她在一个饭店工作。",
      "traditional": "媽媽說，她在一個飯店工作。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma shuō tā zài yí ge fàn diàn gōng zuò",
      "english": "Mom says that she works at a restaurant."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "妈妈说，那是一个中国饭店。",
      "traditional": "媽媽說，那是一個中國飯店。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma shuō nà shì yí ge zhōng guó fàn diàn",
      "english": "Mom says that it is a Chinese restaurant."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "妈妈说，中国菜很好吃。她们学校的学生和老师都爱吃中国菜。",
      "traditional": "媽媽說，中國菜很好吃。她們學校的學生和老師都愛吃中國菜。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma shuō zhōng guó cài hěn hǎo chī tā men xué xiào de xué sheng hé lǎo shī dōu ài chī zhōng guó cài",
      "english": "Mom says that Chinese food is very tasty. The students and teachers at her school all love eating Chinese food."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "妈妈说，她在日本学习要很多钱。",
      "traditional": "媽媽說，她在日本學習要很多錢。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma shuō tā zài rì běn xué xí yào hěn duō qián",
      "english": "Mom says that she needs a lot of money to study in Japan."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "妈妈说，她的爸爸妈妈没有钱。",
      "traditional": "媽媽說，她的爸爸媽媽沒有錢。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma shuō tā de bà ba mā ma méi yǒu qián",
      "english": "Mom says that her dad and mom don’t have money."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "妈妈说，她要学习，也要工作。工作会有钱。",
      "traditional": "媽媽說，她要學習，也要工作。工作會有錢。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma shuō tā yào xué xí yě yào gōng zuò gōng zuò huì yǒu qián",
      "english": "Mom says that she needs to study, and also needs to work. By working, she can have money."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "我的妈妈，她很忙。",
      "traditional": "我的媽媽，她很忙。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ de mā ma tā hěn máng",
      "english": "My mom, she is very busy."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
